      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ravmts'
    female|a||Yet most drugs never meet those four executives — the ones you collect at a pharmacy take another road into the very same agency.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:qznelb'
    female|a||Unless the bill would exceed roughly a hundred million kroner a year, when it must go to the Storting with the budget.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1y3blaa'
    female|a||Same criteria, same agency doing the sums — but who says yes depends on whether the drug is given in a ward or handed across a counter.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:15hsc3h'
    'female|a||And this box is where Norwegian priority setting currently quarrels with itself: the negotiated price is confidential.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:izqr3c'
    female|a||The published assessment shows list prices, so no outsider can recompute the number the decision actually rested on.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7000
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1uiwqf3'
    female|a||Secrecy is defended as what buys Norway the discount; it also means a public decision leans on a figure the public may not see.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:x9f9b5'
    'female|a|grave|Four rooms, one route: whoever calculates does not decide, and whoever decides cannot show you the number.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1did7mn'
    'female|a||Lønning I, reporting in 1987, was among the first national priority commissions anywhere: it sorted all of Norwegian health care into five levels, ranked by severity alone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:hu5hjn'
    female|a||Ten years later Lønning II added expected benefit and a reasonable relation between cost and effect, and its priority groups fed straight into the 1999 Patients' Rights Act.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13560
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1honb18'
    'female|a||Norheim''s committee in 2014 named three criteria outright: health benefit, resource use, and health loss measured across a whole lifetime.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:3mwgt0'
    female|a||That last one counted health a patient had already lost, so an eighty-year-old could barely score on it — the hearing responses were fierce, and the criterion did not survive.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:19r2kq1'
    female|a||So a second group under Jon Magnussen replaced it in 2015 with absolutt prognosetap — the QALYs lost from today forward, not the ones already behind you.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11280
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:138p6ec'
    female|a||Meld. St. 34 took that to the Storting in 2016, and the three criteria we now work with — nytte, ressursbruk, alvorlighet — became national policy.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1fr75xi'
    female|a||Between 1987 and 2015, severity travelled from a rank order to a number — and a number can do something a rank order cannot.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1ydmv67'
    'female|a||Put absolute shortfall on the horizontal axis and the price we accept per QALY on the vertical: the more future health a condition destroys, the more we are willing to pay to save some of it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1c0fi0w'
    female|a||The reference figure at ordinary severity has been about 275 000 kroner per QALY; at the extreme end Magnussen's proposal reached roughly 825 000.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1c1z4b5'
    female|a||Magnussen proposed six discrete severity classes between those ends — the white paper kept the graded logic but left the boundaries to judgement, so this straight line is illustrative, not statutory.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1o25f0b'
    'female|a||Now run nusinersen through the machinery. Nytte: infants with SMA type 1 who would never have sat unsupported gained motor function — the benefit is real and visible.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:3mvip1'
    'female|a||Alvorlighet: untreated, the condition takes almost an entire expected lifetime, so the absolute prognosis loss sits at the very top of the scale, and lifts the acceptable price with it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ekhiuo'
    'female|a||Ressursbruk: at a launch price of several million kroner per patient in the first year, the cost per QALY overshot even that raised ceiling — which is why Beslutningsforum said no in 2017.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1ayg0fd'
    female|a||In February 2018, after a price agreement and further documentation, the same body said yes — but only for patients under eighteen, where the evidence of benefit was strongest.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12600
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1xfw1o'
    'female|a|grave|Across these five parts, that is the whole system in one sentence: Norway never decided whether nusinersen was worth it — it decided how to decide, and the age limit is what four commissions, three criteria and one number produced.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 21400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1q0mlcg'
    'female|a|grave|Same drug, same trials, four months apart: no, then yes with an age limit.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1rf5b4h'
    female|a||One drug got two different answers, and the rulebook behind both is the three criteria of Meld. St. 34, Norway's priority white paper of 2015 to 2016.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12440
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||Severity, once it is a number, still has to travel through the rooms that turn it into a yes or a no — because in Norway the body that calculates is never the body that decides.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||Who decides is one question; where their three criteria came from is another — four public commissions across thirty years.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    female|a||The medicines agency, then called Legemiddelverket, ran the method assessment — how much health the drug buys, and what it costs to buy it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9200
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1sc0whx'
    'female|a||That judgement also has an address: Bestillerforum orders the assessment, the Directorate for Medical Products writes it, Beslutningsforum — the four regional directors — decides; outpatient drugs travel the separate blåresept route.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 15160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:jpy86p'
    female|a||For drugs, the method assessment is written by the Directorate for Medical Products — DMP, called Legemiddelverket until 2024.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8520
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:179zczq'
    female|a||Blaresept, the blue prescription, is reimbursement from the national insurance scheme — and DMP grants it itself, with no forum at all.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:xp8gwb'
